include LICENSE
include CHANGELOG.md
include CONTRIBUTING.md
include SECURITY.md
include README.md
include FAQ.md
recursive-include tests *
recursive-include examples *
global-exclude *.py[cod] *.pyo *.pyd __pycache__ .DS_Store Thumbs.db *.swp *~ *.log *.tmp
prune **/__pycache__
prune **/.pytest_cache
prune **/.mypy_cache
prune **/.ruff_cache
prune **/.venv
prune **/venv
prune **/node_modules
prune **/.stackpilot
prune **/.vscode
prune **/.idea
prune **/coverage
prune **/htmlcov
